 "subs": [
  {
   "text": "This Steam demo is sixteen\npoint nine gigabytes.\nThree people made it.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 4.121,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Seven hundred and seventy\nmegabytes of that download\nis a file they forgot to\ndelete.",
   "start": 4.371,
   "duration": 4.617,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "First, what it is.\nExpedition: Into Darkness\nis a medieval extraction\ncrawler. You go down a\nhole with a torch, you\nfill your bag with\nwhatever you can carry,\nand then you have to walk\nback out with it.",
   "start": 17.238,
   "duration": 11.879,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Five player co-op,\npermadeath, and about a\nthousand people playing it\nwhile I record this. The\nco-op is the part\nreviewers keep praising.",
   "start": 29.367,
   "duration": 7.726,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Now the build. Debug\nsymbols. They're how you\nread a crash report. They\nbelong on a build server,\nnot on your players'\ndrives.",
   "start": 37.343,
   "duration": 8.143,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "The rest is real content,\nto be fair. One scene, and\nfifteen hundred streaming\nbundles behind it.",
   "start": 45.736,
   "duration": 6.576,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "And the store page still\nsays you need eight\ngigabytes of storage.",
   "start": 62.68,
   "duration": 3.938,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "If you ship this year,\nstrip your symbols. It's\none checkbox. Full\nteardown on the channel.",
   "start": 66.868,
   "duration": 5.871,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  }
 ],
